{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07306","headline":"别陈留诸官 · 刘长卿","name":"别陈留诸官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恋此东道主，能令西上迟。\n徘徊暮郊别，惆怅秋风时。\n上国邈千里，夷门难再期。\n行人望落日，归马嘶空陂。\n不愧宝刀赠，维怀琼树枝。\n音尘倘未接，梦寐徒相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}